== no_variable
error[Z0406]: `qq_plot` needs `var`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:3
  |
3 | d.qq_plot()
  |   ^^^^^^^ `var` is missing
  |
  = help: usage: `data.qq_plot(var, distribution: Distribution, by: Var | Vars)`

== a_variable_of_text
error[Z0401]: `qq_plot` compares the values of a variable with the quantiles of a distribution, so it must be numbers, but `name` is placed as categories
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:11
  |
3 | d.qq_plot(name)
  |           ^^^^ categories
  |
  = help: give a variable of numbers, a Float, an Int or a Bool, or an expression that gives one, as in `qq_plot(log(wage))`

== a_variable_of_dates
error[Z0401]: `qq_plot` compares the values of a variable with the quantiles of a distribution, so it must be numbers, but `day` is placed on a scale of dates
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:11
  |
3 | d.qq_plot(day)
  |           ^^^ dates
  |
  = help: give a variable of numbers, a Float, an Int or a Bool, or an expression that gives one, as in `qq_plot(log(wage))`

== a_variable_not_there
error[Z0101]: no variable `scores` in `d`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:11
  |
