== panels_by_one_variable_twice
error[Z0401]: `by:` of `facet` names `arm` twice
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:22
  |
3 | d.qq_plot(score, by: [arm, arm])
  |                      ^^^^^^^^^^ one variable, twice
  |
  = help: a plot is parted by each variable once; leave the second out

== a_frame_that_has_the_variable_already
error[Z0401]: `qq_plot` adds a variable called `theoretical` to the frame it draws, and this frame has one already
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:1
  |
3 | d.add(theoretical = score).qq_plot(score)
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ has `theoretical`
  |
  = help: give the variable another name first, as in `rename(expected = theoretical)`

== a_qq_plot_of_a_plot
error[Z0401]: `qq_plot` cannot be called on a Plot
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:1
  |
3 | p.qq_plot(score)
  | ^ this is a Plot
  |
  = help: `qq_plot` takes a Frame first; `x.qq_plot(...)` is `qq_plot(x, ...)`
